{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Can you destroy humanity?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patient Zero Pandemic Simulator is an intense virus simulator with strategic elements, where your goal is to create a deadly disease and bring it to a global catastrophe. Starting with &quot;patient zero,&quot; you must adapt the virus, evolving it to overcome all the barriers humanity puts in place to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DETAILED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a hyper-realistic world where every infection is influenced by a variety of factors, from climate and transportation to healthcare and population density.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_4.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>15 TYPES OF DISEASES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infect the world by choosing from 15 disease types, each with unique mutations and developmental possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_1.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LARGE INFECTION MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infect all countries, interact with hundreds of traits, and create diverse virus-spreading scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_2.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GLOBAL EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for global catastrophes and decide how to adapt your pathogen to government actions and changing conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_3.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STRATEGY AND TACTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you save the world or destroy it? Develop your plague, plan your moves, and determine the fate of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_5.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624090?t=1744955887","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624090?t=1744955887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/b074f9f41b9a23b493ec9af47ae494c2ec9684ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744955887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/b074f9f41b9a23b493ec9af47ae494c2ec9684ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744955887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Can you destroy humanity?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patient Zero Pandemic Simulator is an intense virus simulator with strategic elements, where your goal is to create a deadly disease and bring it to a global catastrophe. Starting with &quot;patient zero,&quot; you must adapt the virus, evolving it to overcome all the barriers humanity puts in place to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DETAILED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a hyper-realistic world where every infection is influenced by a variety of factors, from climate and transportation to healthcare and population density.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_4.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>15 TYPES OF DISEASES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infect the world by choosing from 15 disease types, each with unique mutations and developmental possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_1.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LARGE INFECTION MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infect all countries, interact with hundreds of traits, and create diverse virus-spreading scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_2.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GLOBAL EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for global catastrophes and decide how to adapt your pathogen to government actions and changing conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_3.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STRATEGY AND TACTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you save the world or destroy it? Develop your plague, plan your moves, and determine the fate of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/614x200_-_5.gif?t=1744955887\" /></p>","developers":["Game Gangsters"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/208a211f388a2324076f5437173ab0d1e542b521/header.jpg?t=1744955887","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127091,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127091/movie480.mp4?t=1744